/given-names></name><name><surname>Mizuno</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Miyawaki</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Cyan-emitting and orange-emitting fluorescent proteins as a donor/acceptor pair for fluorescence resonance energy transfer.</article-title><source>Biochem J</source><volume>381</volume><fpage>307</fpage><lpage>312</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15065984</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004200-Kster1"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>K&#x000f6;ster</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name><name><surname>Fraser</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Tracing transgene expression in living zebrafish embryos.</article-title><source>Dev Biol</source><volume>233</volume><fpage>329</fpage><lpage>46</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11336499</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004200-Shaner1"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shaner</surname><given-names>NC</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Steinbach</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Giepmans</surname><given-names>BN</given-names></name><name><surname>Palmer</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Improved monomeric red, orange and yellow fluorescent proteins derived from <italic>Discosoma</italic> sp. red fluorescent protein.</article-title><source>Nature Biotechnol</source><volume>22</volume><fpage>1567</fpage><lpage>1572</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15558047</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004200-Jackson1"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>EL</g